OL,3,GNEWSATwo people die after serious crash
OL,4,
OL,5,FTwo people have died following a crash
OL,6,Fbetween two vehicles.
OL,8,FA white Mazda Bongo van was involved in
OL,9,Fa collision with a Volvo lorry in Combe
OL,10,FFlorey, near Taunton, Somerset, at
OL,11,Fabout 06:40 BST on Wednesday, said
OL,12,Fpolice.
OL,14,FThe two occupants of the van died at
OL,15,Fthe scene and their families have been
OL,16,Finformed. The A358 is closed at West
OL,17,FBagborough between Williton and
OL,18,FTaunton, with bus services unable to
OL,19,Foperate between the two areas.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
