OL,3,GNEWSATwo people die after serious crash
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe road, which is the main route
OL,6,Fbetween West Somerset and the county
OL,7,Ftown of Taunton, is likely to be shut
OL,8,Ffor much of the day, according to Avon
OL,9,Fand Somerset Police.
